Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:03.34,Titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Master Ichthyostega{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you how the real world works!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino said modern amphibians are better than prehistoric ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm beating him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.98,0:01:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one getting beaten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't modern amphibians cooler?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF SERIOUS PALEONTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A script?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.91,0:01:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Prehistoric vs. Modern Amphibian Showdown"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\fnTrebuchet MS}{\c&HE4A6FF&}Prehistoric Organisms?{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&HFF523C&}Modern Organisms? {\c&HFFFFFF&}{\c&H3AFF64&}Amphibian Show-Off Show!{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You will brag about the coolest traits \Nof ancient and modern amphibians.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,representing modern species: {\c&H3AFF64&}Japanese Tree Frog!{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,representing prehistoric species
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDB98FF&}Ichthyostega!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit lower, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:04.05,Representing Prehistoric Amphibians,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDB98FF&}Representing Prehistoric Amphibians\NIchthyostega
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ichthyostega!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He acts like an apprentice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Host, proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Frog-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,show off your skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My toes are like suction cups...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so they're super useful for sticking to walls and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.57,0:02:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,During the Late Devonian period when Master Ichthyostega lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,fish ruled the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Amidst that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,they evolved from fish and ventured onto land the ultra-early
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,, pioneers of amphibians!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The proof is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,, these 7 digits that evolved from fins!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master's ribs are ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,thick and heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest obstacle for aquatic creatures moving to land is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,gravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Master had thick, long ribs to withstand gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and protect internal organs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...Master is said to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...the first creature in Earth's history \Nto achieve four-legged walking on land!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The first...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,four-legged walker?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Late Devonian,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that first step onto the mainland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:47.69,late devonian,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\b1}Late Devonian, \Napproximately 365 million years ago{\b0}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it was a step to survive in a new world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the very first step toward the prosperity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of amphibians,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and us mammals later on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was also the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So prehistoric creatures were way cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it, Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Discovering great ancient steps through fossils...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and understanding evolution by observing modern life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that is paleontology!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about which is better;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,both are precious and amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me call you Master too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ichthyostega.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Master's Tiktaalik!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:33.75,375-Million-Year-Old Prehistoric Creature Grandmaster Tiktaalik,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF72C5&}375-Million-Year-Old Prehistoric Creature\N Grandmaster Tiktaalik
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Master's senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The prehistoric creature who did push-ups on land first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandmaster Tiktaalik!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty slick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no match for Grandmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Grandmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Master was acting so arrogant until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how vertical hierarchy works!
